#4. Test
Starting balance (100.00) already meets or exceeds the goal (100.00).
Goal reached in 0 months.
Final Balance: 100.00
Total Interest Earned: 0.00


What I Changed?
First, my code printed the monthly table even if the starting balance was already bigger than the goal. 
I added an if check at the start to fix this so it skips the loop and shows "Goal reached in 0 months."


Why does the order of the rules matter: 
The order matters because interest must be calculated on the balance at the start of the month before the new deposit is added.
